# 副簽
(pos:名詞)
<explanation>
yue:喺正式文件或者合約入面，喺主要簽名以外再簽嘅名，用嚟確認或者證明文件嘅真確性；亦指一式多份文件入面嘅副本份（量詞：份、張）
eng:counter-signature; duplicate copy of a document
<eg>
yue:呢份合約除咗要正簽，仲要加個副簽先作實。
eng:Besides the main signature, this contract also requires a counter-signature to be valid.
<eg>
yue:正本留底，副簽就交咗俾律師樓。
eng:The original was kept for record, and the duplicate copy was handed over to the law firm. [end of text]


